mstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759220/extras/d7cc5ad9822b7f8d91eba43d94da61ac.webm?t=1755182290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759220/extras/c2a97f90940d0804b209435118377686.poster.avif?t=1755182290\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759220/extras/c2a97f90940d0804b209435118377686.webp?t=1755182290\" class=\"bb_img\" width=549 height=69 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Get to know the charming residents of Pebble Town, each with their own stories, quirks, and secrets. Strengthen your bonds through heartfelt conversations and meaningful interactions.    <br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759220/extras/a4a6aae6c80d0e9ebefeb510b3bd8ade.poster.avif?t=1755182290\" width=594 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759220/extras/a4a6aae6c80d0e9ebefeb510b3bd8ade.webm?t=1755182290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Pawsome Resort is a cozy life sim with Co-op gameplay where you run an animal hotel in a charming pixel-art village. Design your resort, care for cute animals, grow crops, craft things, complete quests, and bond with villagers. With farming and RPG elements, it's a perfect cozy escape.",
